1b:T721,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Sockboom 跑路了吗？还能用吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"已跑路。2024 年初官网静默失效、无任何通知，2024 年 2 月初起被多个独立跑路名单收录，原因不明。残留节点早已无人维护，不能也不该再用。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"sockboom.store 是官方新站吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不是。whois 显示该域名注册于 2024 年 3 月 9 日——在原版跑路之后，属于接管品牌名收割流量的冒名站，行业当时已有明确预警。不要注册或充值。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Sockboom 官网/最新地址是什么？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"没有了。原版已跑路，不存在「最新地址」；所有「地址发布器」「备用入口」均为蹭名钓鱼，请勿相信。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Sockboom 的余额能退吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"无法退回。静默跑路无联系渠道；声称能帮你退款的均为二次诈骗。请做好账号安全处理并更换服务。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Sockboom 为什么跑路？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"原因至今不明。它是 2024 年初那一轮跑路潮中最令人意外的一例：6 年老牌无声消失，再次说明任何机场都要月付＋备用，资历只能降低概率，不能消除风险。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"怎么识别「借尸还魂」的冒牌机场？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"查 whois：域名注册时间晚于品牌跑路时间的「官网」一律按冒牌处理；再比对原版的官方通知渠道（邮件/TG）是否发过公告。两步即可识破绝大多数收割盘。"}}]}11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":["：Sockboom——运营超过 6 年、以游戏 CN2 专线和学术访问见长的",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/paihangbang/wending-jichang","className":"text-accent hover:underline","children":"老牌机场"}],"——"]}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"已于 2024 年初跑路"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"chil